  "worked_solution": "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14180603/assets/f85c4c0066a850e75910aa3a9fa4330e7c68705e7b19a3e7d1d180cb4052db36.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(-4,0).$ Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(-4,0).$",
